{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14604860","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14604860","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1460486001:1":{"text":"あなたは調査で得た答えを、インドラとセレに伝えた。","source_cn":"你将调查的结果告知了因度厄与席蕾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A6C29915C37204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1460486002:1":{"text":"地下にあるサロクディアは空間や日照に制限があるため、地上のヴェルディア人と比べて、エクシルの方がより繊細で、感情的になりやすい。","source_cn":"位于地下的萨洛克兰由于空间和光照受限的关系，会让艾塞勒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D733CCD2D6F7D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460486003:1":{"text":"そして、変革による警備隊の人手不足で、あちこちに繁殖したキノコや胞子の除去が間に合っていなかった。","source_cn":"而这段时间的动荡变化，让卫队人手不足，无暇清理各地蔓延...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4678F62E3E204AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460486004:1":{"text":"漂う胞子は、各地の空気に少なからず影響を及ぼし、エクシルたちをより不安定にさせていった。","source_cn":"弥漫的孢子或多或少地影响了各地的空气质量，进一步令艾塞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64BE98CFF7BDE3C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460486005:1":{"text":"それに加え、情勢の混乱は人々に不安や焦りを引き起こし、社会に一種の流れや風潮を生みやすい。","source_cn":"而动荡本身就容易导致人们的焦虑与不安，形成社会上的普遍思潮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A28795DB9A5E1A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"